          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "6. Cognitive forcing functions (Buçinca, Malaya & Gajos, 2021)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Friction that compels analytical engagement at decision time: commit-first",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#6-cognitive-forcing-functions-buçinca-malaya-gajos-2021",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "(judge before the AI is revealed), on-demand reveal / wait, **show reasoning",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#6-cognitive-forcing-functions-buçinca-malaya-gajos-2021",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "on request** + surface disagreement/uncertainty. These reduced over-reliance on",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#6-cognitive-forcing-functions-buçinca-malaya-gajos-2021",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "incorrect AI more than explanation-only designs. Costs: effort, often disliked,",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#6-cognitive-forcing-functions-buçinca-malaya-gajos-2021",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "benefit interacts with the user (Need for Cognition) - reserve for high-stakes /",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#6-cognitive-forcing-functions-buçinca-malaya-gajos-2021",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "likely-wrong cases. Adjacent levers: onboarding on error boundaries, selective",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#6-cognitive-forcing-functions-buçinca-malaya-gajos-2021",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "explanations, adjustable outputs.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#6-cognitive-forcing-functions-buçinca-malaya-gajos-2021",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
