    {
      "title": "8. Anthropomorphism, persona & the uncanny valley",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Anthropomorphic cues (persona, warmth, avatar) can raise initial trust but are",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#8-anthropomorphism-persona-the-uncanny-valley",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "mediated by perceived empathy/interaction quality. Uncanny valley (Mori,",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#8-anthropomorphism-persona-the-uncanny-valley",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "1970): near-human-but-not affinity drops sharply; an \"uncanny valley of trust\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#8-anthropomorphism-persona-the-uncanny-valley",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "raises competence expectations the bot can't meet. A warm, fluent, confident",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#8-anthropomorphism-persona-the-uncanny-valley",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "persona manufactures over-trust regardless of correctness (fluency reads as",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#8-anthropomorphism-persona-the-uncanny-valley",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "competence) - match persona confidence to validated capability.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#8-anthropomorphism-persona-the-uncanny-valley",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Design & coaching checklist",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Target appropriate reliance, measured behaviorally (override tracks error) —",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#design-coaching-checklist",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "not a trust survey number or raw agreement.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#design-coaching-checklist",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Set honest expectations before the first error.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#design-coaching-checklist",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Show confidence only if calibrated; communicate uncertainty honestly.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#design-coaching-checklist",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't expect explanations to create skepticism (they raise acceptance); pair",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#design-coaching-checklist",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "with friction; prefer selective explanations on likely-error cases.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#design-coaching-checklist",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Engineer friction where stakes are high (commit-first, on-demand reveal) —",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#design-coaching-checklist",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "and reserve it; it has a cost.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#design-coaching-checklist",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Give users control/adjustability over outputs (restores reliance after errors).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#design-coaching-checklist",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Place the human where they have an information edge, not as a generic reviewer.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#design-coaching-checklist",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Match persona confidence to validated capability.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#design-coaching-checklist",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Treat \"a human reviews it\" as a design problem, not a safeguard.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#design-coaching-checklist",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Anti-patterns",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Optimizing for \"trust\" as a survey number instead of calibrated reliance.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Shipping explanations/confidence and declaring over-reliance solved (they",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Treating a human-in-the-loop step as a guaranteed control.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Letting one visible AI error kill adoption of a net-better tool.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Maxing out a confident anthropomorphic persona on a high-stakes tool.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Assuming \"human + AI\" beats either alone (complementarity is rare).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Conflating trust and reliance in instrumentation.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#anti-patterns",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Operator scenarios (TAM / AI-native workflow)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "\"Team rubber-stamps the AI triage.\" → automation bias/complacency +",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#operator-scenarios-tam-ai-native-workflow",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "over-reliance. Fix: commit-first workflow, surface disagreement, instrument",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#operator-scenarios-tam-ai-native-workflow",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "agreement-on-wrong, reserve the human for context the model lacks.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#operator-scenarios-tam-ai-native-workflow",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Analysts refuse the new recommender.\" → likely algorithm aversion",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#operator-scenarios-tam-ai-native-workflow",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "(experts, post-error, model-vs-own-judgment). Fix: adjustability,",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#operator-scenarios-tam-ai-native-workflow",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "expectation-setting, advisor framing, show win-rate vs. baseline.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#operator-scenarios-tam-ai-native-workflow",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "\"We added explanations and people trust it more - ship it?\" → more",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#operator-scenarios-tam-ai-native-workflow",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "agreement is not more appropriate reliance; verify override tracks error.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#operator-scenarios-tam-ai-native-workflow",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Friendly human persona for the assistant?\" → lifts likability but risks",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#operator-scenarios-tam-ai-native-workflow",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "over-trust and the uncanny valley; keep high-stakes tools capability-honest.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#operator-scenarios-tam-ai-native-workflow",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Human-in-the-loop / override policy?\" → define by resolution (specific",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#operator-scenarios-tam-ai-native-workflow",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "case classes needing independent judgment), not a blanket \"review everything.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/human-ai-interaction-psychology/#operator-scenarios-tam-ai-native-workflow",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
